    "Lighthouse6F uniform purple floor and old blue/gray ring differ from actual pink tiled floor, cyan optical enclosure and glass window ring.",
    "Balcony repeated indoor-window facade and generic flooring differ from actual gray-purple shell, one east window, diagonal paving and blue parapets."
